.TH AGENT-CONTEXT-LINT 1 "2026-08-03" "agent\-context\-lint 1.0.0" "Agent Context Linter"
.SH NAME
agent\-context\-lint \- lint agent instruction files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agent\-context\-lint
[\fIoptions\fR] \fIcommand\fR [\fIarguments\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A deterministic, offline\-by\-default command\-line interface for inspecting
agent instruction files.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B efficiency [repository] [\-\-agent <profile>] [\-\-format
.br
.B terminal|json] [\-\-compare <repository>] [\-\-no\-color] [\-\-width
.br
.B <columns>]
Report instruction\-context efficiency.
.TP
.B explain <target> [\-\-agent <profile>] [\-\-surface <surface>]
.br
.B [\-\-trace <file>] [\-\-format terminal|json]
Explain effective instructions for a target path.
.TP
.B init [repository]
Create a starter repository configuration.
.TP
.B list [repository] [\-\-format terminal|json]
List discovered instruction surfaces.
.TP
.B rules [\-\-format terminal|json]
List installed lint rules.
.TP
.B scan [repository] [\-\-format stylish|json|sarif] [\-\-rule ACLNNN]
.br
.B [\-\-severity <override>] [\-\-fail\-on error|warning|never]
.br
.B [\-\-maximum\-concurrency 1..10] [\-\-profile profile] [\-\-surface
.br
.B surface] [\-\-changed \-\-base ref] [\-\-fix\-dry\-run]
Lint repository agent instruction files.
.TP
.B standards <status|check|update> [\-\-format terminal|json]
.br
.B [\-\-dry\-run] [\-\-cache <directory>]
Inspect, verify, or update standards knowledge.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command help.
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
Show the package version.
.TP
.B \-\-agent profile
Select an exact client profile.
.TP
.B \-\-format format
Select deterministic terminal or JSON output.
.TP
.B \-\-compare repository
Compare against an independently resolved repository source.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-color
Render terminal output without ANSI color.
.TP
.B \-\-width columns
Set terminal width from 40 through 240 columns.
.TP
.B \-\-trace file
Load a repository\-contained resolution\-event trace.
.TP
.B \-\-surface surface
Select a client surface; repeat to select more.
.TP
.B \-\-rule rule
Run only a registered rule; repeat to select more.
.TP
.B \-\-severity override
Override one rule severity as ACLNNN=severity; repeatable.
.TP
.B \-\-fail\-on threshold
Choose the diagnostic failure threshold.
.TP
.B \-\-maximum\-concurrency workers
Bound rule\-family worker concurrency from 1 through 10.
.TP
.B \-\-profile profile
Select a client profile; repeat to select more.
.TP
.B \-\-changed
Select diagnostics changed from one explicit Git base reference.
.TP
.B \-\-base ref
Resolve the exact Git base reference for \-\-changed mode.
.TP
.B \-\-fix\-dry\-run
Preview selected mechanical fixes without writing.
.TP
.B \-\-cache directory
Use an explicit private cache root for update activation.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Preview a signed update without writing cache or lockfile state.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B \&.agent\-context\-lint.yml
Versioned repository configuration. The machine reference embeds its
complete schema and digest.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 for success, 1 for lint policy failure, 2 for usage or operational
failure, and 130 for SIGINT.
.SH COMPLETION
Version\-matched Bash, Zsh, and Fish completion files are installed in the
package completions directory. PowerShell completion is not part of the
version 1 contract.
.SH SEE ALSO
The packaged reference/agent\-context\-lint\-reference.v1.json file is the
complete machine\-readable command, configuration, and rule reference.
